{"articleNo":"2551","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2551&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 후기 졸업예정자 성적취소 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.01","hit":"11630","attachments":[{"name":"졸업예정자성적취소원.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2551&attachNo=1731"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY목각파임B&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009학년도 후기 졸업예정자 성적취소 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2009학년도 후기 졸업예정자에 대하여 성적취소 신청기간을 아래와 같이 안내 하오니 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">신청하시기 바랍니</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◀ 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 ▶</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 신청 자격 : 2009학년도 후기 졸업예정자에 한함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 신청 성적 : 이수한 교과목 중 “F” 성적</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">3. 신청 방법 : 학생이 “성적취소 신청원”작성&nbsp; → 해당 “종합학사행정실” 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 신청 기간 : </span><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2010. 7. 12(월) ~ 2010. 7. 14(수)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></font></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 신청 장소 : 해당 “종합학사행정실”</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6. 제출 서류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 성적취소 신청원 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 7. 1</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 과&nbsp; 장 </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
